  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n   <div class=\"rounded-md p-2 bg-background-100 shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] bg-clip-padding max-w-[800px] sm:border-l-0 sm:border-r-0 sm:border-(--guide-color) sm:w-full mb-6 mt-4 max-w-(--article-max-width)\">\n    <img data-version=\"v1\" alt=\"\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto max-w-full rounded-sm border border-solid border-gray-200\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcset=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6zuZWmw50GsoU3M8UyS9Es/ac3241a490d0665bedab55b6288dfe9f/instagram.png 1x, https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6zuZWmw50GsoU3M8UyS9Es/ac3241a490d0665bedab55b6288dfe9f/instagram.png 2x\" src=\"https://assets.vercel.com/image/upload/contentful/image/e5382hct74si/6zuZWmw50GsoU3M8UyS9Es/ac3241a490d0665bedab55b6288dfe9f/instagram.png\">\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">You can now build bots for Instagram with the new <a href=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters/official/instagram\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters/official/instagram\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">Instagram adapter</a> for Chat SDK.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Bots can send and receive DMs and media, render cards as quick replies and link buttons, show typing indicators, receive reactions, and handle story replies.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col items-stretch justify-start gap-4 flex-initial blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__wrapper\">\n     <div class=\"my-4 rounded-md group/copy relative overflow-hidden border border-[var(--ds-gray-400)] rounded-b-md bg-[var(--ds-bfackground-100)] blog-code-block-module__TEKDOa__codeBlock\" data-geist-code-block=\"\">\n      <div class=\"py-0 pl-4 rounded-t-md h-12 flex items-center border-b border-[var(--ds-gray-400)] bg-[var(--ds-background-200)] pr-3\">\n       <div class=\"gap-2 m-0 min-w-0 mr-auto flex items-center text-[13px] text-[var(--ds-gray-900)]\">\n        <span class=\"min-w-0 inline-block max-w-full truncate break-normal\">lib/bot.ts</span>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"gap-1 flex\">\n        <button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Copy to clipboard\" data-testid=\"copy/button\" class=\"outline-none m-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] font-medium max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:transition-none data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !px-0 geist-new-themed geist-new-tertiary geist-new-tertiary-fill rounded-md bg-transparent !text-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] [--themed-border:_transparent] [--themed-hover-bg:_var(--ds-gray-alpha-200)] [--lighten-color:_rgba(255,_255,_255,_0.8)] data-hover:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-alpha-200)] p-0 w-[var(--geist-form-height)] h-[var(--geist-form-height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_22%))] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_80%))] data-hover:[--themed-border:var(--themed-hover-bg,_var(--ds-gray-200))] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] !size-8 !rounded-[5px] [&amp;_svg]:!text-[var(--ds-gray-900)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\"><span class=\"truncate px-1.5 inline-flex items-center justify-center shrink-0\"> \n          <div class=\"relative size-4\">\n           <div class=\"absolute transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-0 scale-50\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n             <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"m15.56 4-.53.53-8.8 8.8c-.68.68-1.78.68-2.47 0l.53-.54-.53.53-2.79-2.79L.44 10 1.5 8.94l.53.53 2.8 2.8c.1.09.25.09.35 0l8.79-8.8.53-.53z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </div>\n           <div class=\"absolute transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out opacity-100 scale-100\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" data-slot=\"geist-icon\" style=\"color:currentColor\">\n             <path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M8.25 2c.14 0 .25.11.25.25V3H10v-.75C10 1.28 9.22.5 8.25.5h-5.5C1.78.5 1 1.28 1 2.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75H4.5V10H2.75a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm5 4c.14 0 .25.11.25.25v7.5q-.02.23-.25.25h-5.5a.25.25 0 0 1-.25-.25v-7.5c0-.14.11-.25.25-.25zm0 9.5c.97 0 1.75-.78 1.75-1.75v-7.5c0-.97-.78-1.75-1.75-1.75h-5.5C6.78 4.5 6 5.28 6 6.25v7.5c0 .97.78 1.75 1.75 1.75z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n            </svg>\n           </div>\n          </div> \n         </span></button>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <pre class=\"prism-code language-typescript code-block-module__vF3MAa__pre\"><code class=\"font-mono text-left !text-[13px] leading-[20px] break-normal hyphens-none whitespace-pre text-[var(--ds-gray-1000)]\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\" data-geist-code-block=\"true\"><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L1\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"> Chat </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">\"chat\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L2\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"> createInstagramAdapter </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">\"@chat-adapter/instagram\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L3\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L4\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token keyword\">export</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">const</span><span class=\"token plain\"> bot </span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">new</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name\">Chat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L5\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  userName</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token string\">\"mybot\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L6\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  adapters</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L7\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">    instagram</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token function\">createInstagramAdapter</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L8\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L9\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L10\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\" style=\"display:inline-block\">\n</span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L11\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">bot</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">onDirectMessage</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">async</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token plain\">thread</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span><span class=\"token plain\"> message</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token operator\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L12\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\">  </span><span class=\"token keyword\">await</span><span class=\"token plain\"> thread</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">post</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Hello from Instagram!\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span></div></div><div class=\"line\" data-geist-code-block-line=\"true\" id=\"C0711e2d0-L13\" style=\"font-feature-settings:&quot;liga&quot; off\"><div class=\"token-line\"><span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></div></div></code></pre>\n     </div>\n     <p class=\"text-center text-copy-14 text-gray-900\">Reply to a direct message on Instagram</p>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">The adapter connects through Meta's Instagram Messaging API and requires a professional Business or Creator account.</p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Messages are buffered, so streamed responses send as one message when the stream completes. Meta enforces a 24-hour messaging window, so bots can only reply within a day of the user's last message.<!-- --></p>\n    <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Read the <a href=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters/official/instagram\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters/official/instagram\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">documentation</a> to get started or browse the <a href=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://chat-sdk.dev/adapters\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">adapter directory</a>.</p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel 的 Chat SDK 现在包含 Instagram 适配器，允许开发者构建能够发送和接收 DMs、媒体、快速回复，并通过 Meta 的 Instagram Messaging API 处理故事回复的机器人。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel 的 Chat SDK 现在包含 Instagram 适配器，允许开发者构建能够发送和接收 DMs、媒体、快速回复，并通过 Meta 的 Instagram Messaging API 处理故事回复的机器人。",
  "summary": "本文宣布 Vercel 的 Chat SDK 新增 Instagram 适配器。该适配器通过 Meta 的 Instagram Messaging API 连接，支持发送和接收直接消息、媒体、快速回复卡片、链接按钮、输入指示器、反应以及故事回复。机器人只能在用户上一次消息后的 24 小时窗口内回复，流式响应会在流结束后一次性缓冲发送。示例代码展示了如何实例化适配器并响应直接消息。发布说明中包含适配器文档和更广泛适配器目录的链接。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "新的 Instagram 适配器让 Chat SDK 机器人能够发送/接收 DMs、媒体、快速回复和故事回复。",
      "explanation": "它将 SDK 的社交媒体覆盖范围扩展到之前支持的平台之外，为 Instagram 的消息功能提供统一接口。"
    },
    {
      "point": "机器人受 Meta 的 24‑hour 消息窗口和流缓冲限制。",
      "explanation": "适配器强制执行平台政策，回复必须在用户最后一条消息后的 24 小时内完成，流式响应在流结束后一次性发送。"
    },
    {
      "point": "简洁的代码片段演示了适配器初始化和简单的 DM 响应。",
      "explanation": "示例展示了如何创建带有 Instagram 适配器的 Chat 实例并处理传入消息，使集成对开发者更友好。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "机器人可以发送和接收 DMs 与媒体，渲染卡片为快速回复和链接按钮，显示输入指示器，接收反应，并处理故事回复。",
    "Meta 强制执行 24‑hour 消息窗口，因此机器人只能在用户最后一条消息后的一天内回复。"
  ],
